  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A sealed glass container with dimensions <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span>, and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"H\"></span> contains <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N\"></span> molecules of an ideal gas. The force acting on one of the container sides with area <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"WH\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the temperature of the gas?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{FWH}{k_{B}N}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{FWH}{NR}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{FL}{k_{B}N}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{FL}{NR}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
